/ Stage 9 (decision 175): converting a value to another type is that value's birth, so the new type's create fires.
/ "a.txt" is text; as a path it is a new value, born through the path type.
Start
- set %created% = 0
- bind CountCreated to run after %!app.type.path.on.create%
- set %p% = "a.txt" as path
- assert %created% equals 1, "converting to another type is a birth"

CountCreated
- set %created% = %created% + 1
